  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA single continuous 5-second shot capturing a young woman waking up in a sunlit bedroom, featuring a slow dolly-in movement that transitions from a wider view of the bed to a closer focus on her languid stretching and sleepy expression. The scene emphasizes soft morning light filtering through sheer curtains, low-saturation pastel tones, and a cozy,慵懒 (languid) atmosphere.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nA cozy bedroom interior bathed in soft morning light. White sheer curtains hang on the left side of the frame, diffusing sunlight into volumetric beams that cut across the room. The color palette consists of low-saturation beige, light gray, and pale pink. A bed with松软 (soft/loose) beige linens occupies the right side. Dust motes dance in the light shafts. The camera starts slightly wider to establish the bed and window, then slowly pushes forward.\n**Audio Description**: Ambient morning soundscape with faint birdsong outside, soft rustling of bedsheets, and a gentle, warm atmospheric pad music at low volume.\n\n# Subjects Description\n<ID_A>\n- *Gender*: Female.\n- *Race/Ethnicity*: East Asian.\n- *Age*: Young adult.\n- *Appearance features*: Shoulder-length dark hair slightly messy from sleep, wearing pale pink or light gray comfortable pajamas. Skin tone is natural and soft.\n- *Vocal Characteristics*: N/A (No dialogue).\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nThe camera executes a slow, smooth Dolly In, starting with a wider framing that shows the bed and window, gradually moving closer to frame <ID_A>'s upper body by the end. <ID_A> lies on the right side of the bed, initially still. She slowly inhales, her shoulders rising slightly, then lifts both arms above her head in a long stretch, fingers extending. Her eyes remain half-closed, eyelids heavy. As the camera nears, she lowers her arms and brings her hands to her face, gently rubbing her eyes with knuckles. The side-backlight creates a glowing rim light around her hair and silhouette. Sunlight flares softly through the white curtains on the left as the parallax shifts during the push-in. The bedsheets crumple naturally under her movement.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\nVisual style is cinematic and lifestyle-oriented, resembling high-quality commercial photography. Color palette is muted and pastel: beige, soft white, pale pink, and cool gray shadows. Lighting is high-key but diffused, utilizing side-backlighting to create depth and separation (rim light) without harsh contrasts. Textures emphasize the softness of the sheets and the translucency of the curtains. Image quality is sharp with a shallow depth of field that keeps the subject in focus while slightly softening the background.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\nThe atmosphere is peaceful, intimate, and lazy. It evokes the feeling of a slow weekend morning, safety, and comfort. The emotional tone is calm and rejuvenating, focusing on the simple pleasure of waking up naturally.",
